    "directions": [
      "Preheat oven to 200°C (400°F).",
      "In a large bowl, whisk together cornmeal, plain flour, fine sea salt, baking powder, and smoked paprika.",
      "In another bowl, mix melted unsalted butter, honey, and eggs until well combined.",
      "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until just combined.",
      "Fold in grated cheddar and pickled jalapeños.",
      "Spoon the batter into muffin tins, filling each about three-quarters full.",
      "Sprinkle with Lizi’s Low Sugar Granola.",
      "Bake for 20-25 minutes or until golden brown and a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.",
      "Let cool slightly before serving."
    ],
